{"parentUuid":"128aa5e4-2b24-4156-8485-df176d08d907","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/denis/ros2_ws/src","sessionId":"7525ea68-9b14-4c16-85a8-3d457837ea00","version":"2.1.38","gitBranch":"main","slug":"rustling-munching-cook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_012bhgcyySzD9JKZeNcHCbhW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Phase 3: Quality Report\n\n## CLAUDE.md Quality Report\n\n### Summary\n- Files found: 1\n- Score: **72/100 (Grade: B)**\n- Status: Good foundation, several stale/missing items\n\n### File Assessment: `./CLAUDE.md` (Project Root)\n\n| Criterion | Score | Notes |\n|-----------|-------|-------|\n| Commands/workflows | 16/20 | Build commands good. Launch sequence outdated (manual 4-terminal vs `go2_autonav.sh` as primary). Kill command outdated (now integrated in autonav) |\n| Architecture clarity | 18/20 | Excellent — control stack, TF tree, pipelines all clear |\n| Non-obvious patterns | 10/15 | Good runtime notes, but missing key gotchas discovered this session |\n| Conciseness | 14/15 | Well-structured, no fluff |\n| Currency | 6/15 | **Multiple stale values**: velocities, planner type, initial pose workflow |\n| Actionability | 8/15 | Manual 4-terminal launch is now secondary; auto-pose not mentioned |\n\n### Stale Items Found\n\n| What CLAUDE.md says | Current reality |\n|---------------------|-----------------|\n| \"max velocity: 0.30 m/s forward, 0.50 rad/s rotation\" (line 94) | Now **0.22 m/s, 0.35 rad/s** |\n| \"AMCL + DWB local planner\" (line 56) | Global planner is now **SmacPlanner2D** (DWB still local) |\n| \"Set initial pose in RViz before starting patrol\" (line 91) | `go2_autonav.sh` now does **auto initial pose + AMCL convergence wait** |\n| `GO2_KILL_GZ=1 ~/ros2_ws/src/Scripts/go2_kill_terms.sh` (line 42) | Now **integrated into `go2_autonav.sh`** (auto-kills before launch) |\n| Nav2 params described as \"AMCL, DWB, costmaps\" (line 81) | Now also includes **SmacPlanner2D, collision_monitor, velocity_smoother** |\n| No mention of global costmap obstacle_layer disabled | Currently **disabled** for route stability |\n\n### Missing Items\n\n- **Nav2 tuning context**: Global costmap uses static-only (no runtime obstacle_layer), inflation values, cost_scaling rationale\n- **Spawn parameters**: `SPAWN_Z=0.40` for safe spawn, initial position at Lobby waypoint\n- **AMCL convergence**: `require_amcl_convergence=true` is a critical runtime behavior\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4: Proposed Updates\n\n### Update 1: Fix stale velocities and planner (line 56, 81, 94)\n\n```diff\n-**Control stack**: Gazebo Harmonic → ros_gz_bridge → CHAMP quadruped controller → Dual EKF filters → Nav2 (AMCL + DWB local planner)\n+**Control stack**: Gazebo Harmonic → ros_gz_bridge → CHAMP quadruped controller → Dual EKF filters → Nav2 (AMCL + SmacPlanner2D global / DWB local)\n```\n\n```diff\n-| `unitree_go2_sim/config/nav2_go2_params.yaml` | Nav2 parameters (AMCL, DWB, costmaps) — canonical source (`unitree_go2_ros2/config/` has symlinks) |\n+| `unitree_go2_sim/config/nav2_go2_params.yaml` | Nav2 parameters (AMCL, SmacPlanner2D, DWB, costmaps, collision_monitor) — canonical source (`unitree_go2_ros2/config/` has symlinks) |\n```\n\n```diff\n-- Robot radius: 0.30m, max velocity: 0.30 m/s forward, 0.50 rad/s rotation (tuned to CHAMP gait limits)\n+- Robot radius: 0.30m, max velocity: 0.22 m/s forward, 0.35 rad/s rotation (tuned for stable gait near walls)\n```\n\n### Update 2: Fix launch/kill workflow (lines 40-42, 91)\n\n```diff\n-Or use the all-in-one script: `~/ros2_ws/src/Scripts/go2_autonav.sh`\n-\n-Kill everything: `GO2_KILL_GZ=1 ~/ros2_ws/src/Scripts/go2_kill_terms.sh`\n+Or use the all-in-one script (auto-kills previous session before launch):\n+```bash\n+~/ros2_ws/src/Scripts/go2_autonav.sh\n+```\n+\n+Kill manually if needed: `GO2_KILL_GZ=1 ~/ros2_ws/src/Scripts/go2_kill_terms.sh`\n```\n\n```diff\n-- Set initial pose in RViz (\"2D Pose Estimate\") before starting patrol\n+- `go2_autonav.sh` auto-publishes initial pose and waits for AMCL convergence — no manual RViz pose needed\n```\n\n### Update 3: Add Nav2 tuning context (new section after Key Configuration Files)\n\n```diff\n+## Nav2 Tuning Notes\n+\n+- Global costmap uses **static_layer + inflation only** (obstacle_layer disabled) for stable global paths; local costmap keeps obstacle_layer for reactive avoidance\n+- Global planner: **SmacPlanner2D** (replaced NavFn — better path quality in narrow corridors between dividers)\n+- Inflation: global 0.40m / cost_scaling 5.0, local 0.35m / cost_scaling 6.0\n+- Spawn Z=0.40m to prevent robot falling through ground plane at start\n+- Robot spawns at Lobby waypoint (-2.0, -1.6) so patrol begins immediately\n```\n\n---\n\n¿Aplico estos cambios al CLAUDE.md?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":113736,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CY2aQeSq6L5JdS7NFXqCN","type":"assistant","uuid":"3a100392-d6c9-456a-a926-b656b6f91aae","timestamp":"2026-02-11T16:13:21.354Z"}
