{"parentUuid":"0b56ee59-e36d-404f-af4d-33b5a1abd270","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/denis/ros2_ws/src","sessionId":"7525ea68-9b14-4c16-85a8-3d457837ea00","version":"2.1.38","gitBranch":"main","slug":"rustling-munching-cook","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QrkW9iDie78VBNqwWX8AWg","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/denis/ros2_ws/src/CLAUDE.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"1ba86a28-208f-4110-a43c-d1fea482492c","timestamp":"2026-02-11T16:14:57.122Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/home/denis/ros2_ws/src/CLAUDE.md","oldString":"- Robot radius: 0.30m, max velocity: 0.30 m/s forward, 0.50 rad/s rotation (tuned to CHAMP gait limits)","newString":"- Robot radius: 0.30m, max velocity: 0.22 m/s forward, 0.35 rad/s rotation (tuned for stable gait near walls)","originalFile":"# CLAUDE.md\n\nThis file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.\n\n## Project Overview\n\nAutonomous industrial inspection system using a Unitree Go2 quadruped robot with Nav2 navigation and ArUco marker detection, running on **ROS 2 Jazzy** / **Ubuntu 24.04** with **Gazebo Harmonic** simulation.\n\nThe robot patrols 4 office waypoints (Lobby, Corridor, Office, Storage), navigates via Nav2, and verifies ArUco markers (IDs 100-103, DICT_4X4_1000) at each checkpoint. Results are logged to CSV with images.\n\n## Build & Test Commands\n\nAll commands run from `~/ros2_ws`:\n\n```bash\ncolcon build --symlink-install                                    # build all\ncolcon build --symlink-install --packages-select <package>        # build one package\nsource install/setup.bash                                         # source after every build\ncolcon test --packages-select aruco_markers                       # run aruco tests (GTest)\naruco_markers/scripts/unit_test.sh                                # run aruco unit tests directly\naruco_markers/scripts/format.sh                                   # C++ formatting (ament_uncrustify)\n```\n\n## Launch Sequence (4 terminals, source workspace in each)\n\n```bash\n# T1: Simulation\nros2 launch unitree_go2_sim unitree_go2_launch.py world:=office_patrol.sdf\n\n# T2: Navigation (AMCL + Nav2)\nros2 launch unitree_go2_sim nav2_patrol_launch.py map:=~/ros2_ws/src/unitree_go2_ros2/maps/office_patrol_map.yaml\n\n# T3: ArUco detection\nros2 launch unitree_go2_sim aruco_detection_launch.py\n\n# T4: Patrol controller\nros2 run unitree_go2_sim patrol_controller.py\n```\n\nOr use the all-in-one script: `~/ros2_ws/src/Scripts/go2_autonav.sh`\n\nKill everything: `GO2_KILL_GZ=1 ~/ros2_ws/src/Scripts/go2_kill_terms.sh`\n\n## Package Structure\n\n- **`aruco_markers/aruco_markers/`** — C++ node for ArUco detection using OpenCV. Source in `src/`, headers in `include/aruco_markers/`, tests in `test/` (GTest).\n- **`aruco_markers/aruco_markers_msgs/`** — Custom messages: `Marker` (id, pose, pixel coords) and `MarkerArray`.\n- **`unitree_go2_ros2/unitree_go2_sim/`** — Launch files (`launch/`), Python scripts (`scripts/` — patrol_controller, camera_info_publisher), config YAML (`config/`).\n- **`unitree_go2_ros2/unitree_go2_description/`** — URDF/xacro (`urdf/`), Gazebo worlds (`worlds/`), ArUco marker models (`models/`), meshes.\n- **`unitree_go2_ros2/champ/`** + **`champ_base/`** — CHAMP quadruped locomotion framework and ROS drivers (controller, state estimation, EKF).\n- **`unitree_go2_ros2/config/`** — Nav2 params (`nav2_go2_params.yaml`), SLAM params, RViz configs.\n- **`Scripts/`** — Bash launcher scripts: `go2_autonav.sh` (all-in-one), `go2_launcher.sh` (base launcher), `go2_nav2_map.sh` (nav2+map), `go2_patrol_nav.sh` (patrol nav), `go2_kill_terms.sh` (kill all), `go2_reset_localization.sh` (reset AMCL pose).\n\n## Architecture\n\n**Control stack**: Gazebo Harmonic → ros_gz_bridge → CHAMP quadruped controller → Dual EKF filters → Nav2 (AMCL + SmacPlanner2D global / DWB local)\n\n**TF tree**: `map` → (AMCL) → `odom` → (EKF) → `base_link` → `base_footprint` → leg links\n\n**Sensor pipeline**: Velodyne PointCloud2 → `pointcloud_to_laserscan` → `/scan` (LaserScan) → Nav2 costmaps\n\n**ArUco pipeline**: `/rgb_image` + `/rgb_image/camera_info` → `aruco_markers` node → `/aruco/markers` (MarkerArray) + `/aruco/result` (debug image)\n\n**Patrol controller** (`patrol_controller.py`): Python node using `nav2_simple_commander.BasicNavigator`. Navigates waypoints, polls `/aruco/markers`, retries up to 3 times with optional in-place rotation, logs to CSV at `~/inspection_data/`.\n\n## Coding Conventions\n\n- **Python**: PEP 8, 4-space indent, `snake_case` functions/vars, `CamelCase` classes\n- **C++**: Format with `aruco_markers/scripts/format.sh` (ament_uncrustify)\n- **ROS 2**: Package names `lowercase_with_underscores`, topics `/lowercase/with/slashes`\n- **All packages**: `ament_cmake` build system\n\n## Commit Style\n\nShort imperative summaries (e.g., \"Add ...\", \"Fix ...\", \"Adjust ...\"). Add body for multi-area changes. Include affected packages and commands run (`colcon build`, `colcon test`).\n\n## Key Configuration Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `unitree_go2_sim/config/nav2_go2_params.yaml` | Nav2 parameters (AMCL, SmacPlanner2D, DWB, costmaps, collision_monitor) — canonical source (`unitree_go2_ros2/config/` has symlinks) |\n| `unitree_go2_sim/config/patrol_waypoints.yaml` | Patrol waypoints with marker IDs |\n| `unitree_go2_sim/config/gait/gait.yaml` | Quadruped gait parameters |\n| `unitree_go2_sim/config/ros_control/ros_control.yaml` | Joint controllers (250 Hz) |\n| `unitree_go2_description/worlds/office_patrol.sdf` | Gazebo world with ArUco markers |\n\n## Important Runtime Notes\n\n- Always `source install/setup.bash` in every terminal before launching\n- Set `GZ_SIM_RESOURCE_PATH` to include `unitree_go2_description/models` if marker models are missing (launcher scripts handle this)\n- Set initial pose in RViz (\"2D Pose Estimate\") before starting patrol\n- ArUco markers are 300mm code on 340mm panel (20mm quiet zone), placed at ground level\n- Waypoints are offset ~0.9m from marker positions to stay outside Nav2 inflation radius\n- Robot radius: 0.30m, max velocity: 0.30 m/s forward, 0.50 rad/s rotation (tuned to CHAMP gait limits)\n- Inspection output: `~/inspection_data/inspection_log.csv` + `~/inspection_data/images/`\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":91,"oldLines":5,"newStart":91,"newLines":5,"lines":[" - Set initial pose in RViz (\"2D Pose Estimate\") before starting patrol"," - ArUco markers are 300mm code on 340mm panel (20mm quiet zone), placed at ground level"," - Waypoints are offset ~0.9m from marker positions to stay outside Nav2 inflation radius","-- Robot radius: 0.30m, max velocity: 0.30 m/s forward, 0.50 rad/s rotation (tuned to CHAMP gait limits)","+- Robot radius: 0.30m, max velocity: 0.22 m/s forward, 0.35 rad/s rotation (tuned for stable gait near walls)"," - Inspection output: `~/inspection_data/inspection_log.csv` + `~/inspection_data/images/`"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0b56ee59-e36d-404f-af4d-33b5a1abd270"}
