\n\n**TF tree**: `map` → (AMCL) → `odom` → (EKF) → `base_link` → `base_footprint` → leg links\n\n**Sensor pipeline**: Velodyne PointCloud2 → `pointcloud_to_laserscan` → `/scan` (LaserScan) → Nav2 costmaps\n\n**ArUco pipeline**: `/rgb_image` + `/rgb_image/camera_info` → `aruco_markers` node → `/aruco/markers` (MarkerArray) + `/aruco/result` (debug image)\n\n**Patrol controller** (`patrol_controller.py`): Python node using `nav2_simple_commander.BasicNavigator`. Navigates waypoints, polls `/aruco/markers`, retries up to 3 times with optional in-place rotation, logs to CSV at `~/inspection_data/`.\n\n## Coding Conventions\n\n- **Python**: PEP 8, 4-space indent, `snake_case` functions/vars, `CamelCase` classes\n- **C++**: Format with `aruco_markers/scripts/format.sh` (ament_uncrustify)\n- **ROS 2**: Package names `lowercase_with_underscores`, topics `/lowercase/with/slashes`\n- **All packages**: `ament_cmake` build system\n\n## Commit Style\n\nShort imperative summaries (e.g., \"Add ...\", \"Fix ...\", \"Adjust ...\"). Add body for multi-area changes. Include affected packages and commands run (`colcon build`, `colcon test`).\n\n## Key Configuration Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `unitree_go2_sim/config/nav2_go2_params.yaml` | Nav2 parameters (AMCL, SmacPlanner2D, DWB, costmaps, collision_monitor) — canonical source (`unitree_go2_ros2/config/` has symlinks) |\n| `unitree_go2_sim/config/patrol_waypoints.yaml` | Patrol waypoints with marker IDs |\n| `unitree_go2_sim/config/gait/gait.yaml` | Quadruped gait parameters |\n| `unitree_go2_sim/config/ros_control/ros_control.yaml` | Joint controllers (250 Hz) |\n| `unitree_go2_description/worlds/office_patrol.sdf` | Gazebo world with ArUco markers |\n\n## Important Runtime Notes\n\n- Always `source install/setup.bash` in every terminal before launching\n- Set `GZ_SIM_RESOURCE_PATH` to include `unitree_go2_description/models` if marker models are missing (launcher scripts handle this)\n- Set initial pose in RV